{"id":"28c0e418ba5c32db","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-combinatorial-rectangle.md","title":"Combinatorial Rectangle","display":"df-combinatorial-rectangle — Combinatorial Rectangle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-combinatorial-rectangle","aliases":["28-df-combinatorial-rectangle","Combinatorial Rectangle"],"display":"df-combinatorial-rectangle — Combinatorial Rectangle","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.2.2","source_printed_pages":"273–274","source_pdf_pages":"299–300","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-combinatorial-rectangle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-combinatorial-rectangle</span><span>Combinatorial Rectangle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-combinatorial-rectangle — Combinatorial Rectangle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"273–274"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"299–300"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times Y\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times Y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rect}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists B\\subseteq Y\\ R=A\\times B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rect}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists B\\subseteq Y\\ R=A\\times B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mono}_b(R,f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(x,y)\\in R\\ f(x,y)=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mono}_b(R,f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(x,y)\\in R\\ f(x,y)=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>组合矩形与通信协议可独立定义；正确确定型协议的每个叶输入集是单色矩形，这一性质用于下界而不是矩形定义本身的依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§13.2.2，印刷页 273–274；PDF 页 299–300。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rect}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists B\\subseteq Y\\ R=A\\times B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mono}_b(R,f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(x,y)\\in R\\ f(x,y)=b.","display":true}],"bytes":1228,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通信下界：[[28-df-combinatorial-rectangle]]、[[28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound]]。"},{"id":"fb160a0659b0d45d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}